# dnsmasq's localservice answers only directly attached subnets, so VPN clients (the IPsec road
# warrior pool, site-to-site and Tailscale peers: routed, not attached) were ignored while the UI
# hands them the router as their DNS server. The firewall zones decide instead, and the WAN is
# refused before any user rule (chain-pre/input_wan/10-er4-mgmt.nft).
uci -q set dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].localservice=0
uci commit dhcp
exit 0
